abstract: >-
  Zero-dependency Python toolkit and daily-updated 9-company benchmark sample for
  quantitative biotech investment research, FDA PDUFA target action dates, SEC Form
  10-Q/10-K cash-runway modeling, and risk-adjusted NPV (rNPV) valuation. Full 600+
  biotech coverage and primary-source verification are available at https://biosniper.co.
